----------rice----------
installed sddm, mangowm, kitty, fuzzel, mangobar, wl-clipboard, grim, slurp, wlogout, xorg-xwayland, xlockmore, dunst

sudo systemctl enable --now sddm
cp everything in .config to ~/.config

----------applets----------
install blueman

----------fonts----------
install ttf-roboto, ttf-roboto-slab, maplemono-nf, ttf-nerd-fonts-symbols
copy .config/fontconfig into ~/.config/fontconfig

----------neovim----------
install neovim-nightly-bin, tree-sitter, tree-sitter-cli, rustup, nodejs-n
sudo n i latest
rustup default stable

git clone https://github.com/nautrw/nvim .config/nvim
echo "open nvim next time to see changes"

----------shell----------
install zsh, zsh-fast-syntax-highlighting, eza, zsh-auto-venv-git, zsh-vi-mode

copy .zshrc into ~/.zshrc

----------optional----------
---obs---
install v4l2loopback-dkms for virtual camera support in obs

---window picker for screrenshare--
install xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, wlr-utils-bin, tesseract-data-eng
have .config/xdg-desktop-portal-wlr/config in ~/.config

---yazi---
install yazi, xdg-desktop-portal-termfilechooser-hunkyburrito-git

copy .config/xdg-desktop-portal-termfilechooser/config to ~/.config
copy .config/xdg-desktop-portal-wlr/config to ~/.config

`ya pkg install` to install all packages from .config/yazi/package.toml
